412: % VI. EXPERIMENTAL SETUP AND VALIDATION
413: \section{Experimental Setup and Validation}
414: 
415: \subsection{Cluster Environment}
416: All experiments are conducted on a multi-node Minikube cluster configured as shown in Table~\ref{tab:env-spec}.
