441: \subsection{Fault Injection Methodology}
442: Each experiment follows a three-phase methodology: (i)~establish a healthy cluster baseline; (ii)~inject a specific network fault and observe native Kubernetes behavior (no operator); (iii)~enable the operator and verify automated detection and recovery.
443: 
